cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use uibc-core or UIBC in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "uibc-core: Verifiable Evidence Packages for Autonomous AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  uibc-core is a reference implementation of UIBC (Uniform Identity-Behavior Chain):
  verifiable evidence packages for autonomous AI agents, built on the LGD principles
  of Registry, Evidence and Gates. Every agent action can be sealed into a
  submission.uibc package (identity + lifecycle events + content-hashed evidence +
  evidence root + optional seal), then verified offline.
